  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Ref Log",
    "overview": "flopwire feels like an attributable operations record rather than a generic SaaS dashboard. State flows in one direction, mutations remain legible as history, and every health signal answers what changed, where, and who can act.",
    "keyCharacteristics": ["Health-first and causal, not metric-first.","Flat, attributable, and operational.","Restrained system typography with monospace reserved for identifiers and measurements.","One visible ingest-to-index flow anchors the primary surface."],
